  "body": "Extend the authenticated Road7 CPU geometry observation with actual candidate vertex UV/normals, material, stage texture transforms, effective/default CPU samplers, and bounded resident RAM or readonly asset bytes. Reuse the unchanged600s child/630s container path and preserve every existing source/verdict file.\n\nThe receiver independently binds target/NPZ/source vertices/stages/textures, recomputes barycentric UV and homogeneous texture coordinates, and authenticates raw byte sizes/SHA. Missing caches remain unavailable; no forced texture reload/GPU extraction/render setting change. All image and geometry gates stay strict, original3/4PASS/overallFAIL remains, and CPU state is not GPU pixel ownership or shader-result proof. Focused110 CPU regressions/actionlint pass;full exact-sourceCI and one fresh whole-branch review precede one versioned zero-model hosted observation. Draft only,no publication or merge.\n",
